[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495643791","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99594#issuecomment-2495643791","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99594","id":2495643791,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UwICP","user":{"login":"tetrapod00","id":145553014,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKz2dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145553014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00","html_url":"https://github.com/tetrapod00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-23T20:20:10Z","updated_at":"2024-11-23T20:20:10Z","body":"For testing, I re-uploaded the two extreme MRPs from the issue for convenience:\r\n- Many small bottom panel tabs (made by @JekSun97): [mrp-bottom-panel-many-small.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17882421/mrp-bottom-panel-many-small.zip)\r\n- Few large bottom panel tabs, made by me: [mrp-bottom-panel-few-big.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17882422/mrp-bottom-panel-few-big.zip)\r\n\r\nThis PR handles both of them just fine:\r\n![godot windows editor x86_64_RXN3MlIZaH](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac8357f1-3e40-485b-a958-3fe94f42be05)\r\n![godot windows editor x86_64_ZLIEwlNIoM](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b9b2b5df-c769-4b9e-b790-eae1106d3ba1)\r\n\r\nI'm not sure why, but in the Many Small MRP, this PR can't open any of the custom bottom panel tabs besides `Test0`. I'm not sure if that's a problem with this PR or with the MRP. These MRPs are not necessarily robust implementations of bottom panel plugins; they mostly exist as proof of concept of the problem existing.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a858a89-3924-468c-b2ea-9a9877005a9a\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSo the really bad cases seem solved by this (once the issue with Many Small is solved). I also tested casually with a more normal workload using only built-in bottom panels, and it works as expected.\r\n\r\nIs it possible to have the popup appear so the base is aligned with the top of the three dot button, rather than covering it?\r\n![godot windows editor x86_64_ukTKiBNi89](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b9329a56-b053-4faf-9a94-fec499b72ef4)\r\n\r\nOther three dot buttons spawn their popups directly below the button, they don't cover the button:\r\n![godot windows editor x86_64_96oBLgxudu](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/92417165-c69c-43cf-80f1-ad4430eb1219)\r\n![godot windows editor x86_64_3v163izSS0](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/86012e84-9549-4bd2-acfa-80bb2c9a202d)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2495643791/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2496006938","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99594#issuecomment-2496006938","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99594","id":2496006938,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Uxgsa","user":{"login":"Giganzo","id":158825920,"node_id":"U_kgDOCXd9wA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158825920